app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

history
  tab ]        tab        pane           on
  shift+tab [  shift+tab  previous pane  on
  o            o          browser        on
  H            H          back to head   off
  z            z          zoom           on
  esc          esc        unzoom         on
  space        space      use as base    on
  enter        ↵          open           off
  /            /          filter         off
  r ctrl+r     r          retry          off

graph
  up k      ↑/k     up             on
  down j    ↓/j     down           on
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up        on
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down      on
  home g    g/home  newest         on
  end G     G/end   oldest loaded  on
  enter     ↵       diff           on
  r ctrl+r  r       retry          off
